\newlabel{fig:CFD_tests}{{B2}{53}{Frequency distribution comparison of equilibrium angles between CFD trajectory calculations and the IMPACTS ellipse fit data for all eight 2020 flights (top row) and all thirteen 2023 flights (middle row). (Bottom row) Scatterplot of the y position (left) and z position (right) from the center of the simulated 2D-S volume and corresponding equilibrium angle for all $4,000$ CFD trajectories for 2020 (blue) and 2023 (orange) configurations in the H and V channels. Only aspect ratios less than 0.4 in the NGL were included in order to better highlight the $\pm 70^{\circ }$ needle/column mode in the IMPACTS ellipse fit data}{figure.caption.26}{}}
